@startuml player_pickup

package player {
  class Player {
    -- Fields (pickup related) --
    - holding: boolean
    - heldBomb: ObjBomb
    - heldPot: ObjPot
    - heldRock: ObjRock
    - heldChicken: NpcChicken
    - pendingPickupEntity: Entity
    - pendingPickupIndex: int
    - pickupCooldown: int
    - PICKUP_COOLDOWN_FRAMES: int {static, final}
    - state: PlayerState
    - spriteNum: int
    - spriteCounter: int

    -- Methods (pickup related) --
    + startPickup(e:Entity): void
    + startPickup(nearbyIndex:int): void
    + finishPickup(): void
    + fallbackToHoldWalk(): void
    + findNearbyObjectIndex(): int
    + getNearbyEntity(p:Player): Entity
    + isThrowKeyJustPressed(): boolean
    + isThrowKeyPressed(): boolean
    + setState(s:PlayerState): void
    + setSpriteNum(n:int): void
    + setSpriteCounter(n:int): void
  }
}

package object {
  class ObjBomb {
    + isPickable(): boolean
    + getAlive(): boolean
    + onPickedUp(): void
  }
  class ObjPot {
    + isPickable(): boolean
    + getAlive(): boolean
    + onPickedUp(): void
  }
  class ObjRock {
    + isPickable(): boolean
    + getAlive(): boolean
    + onPickedUp(): void
  }
}

package npc {
  class NpcChicken {
    + isPickable(): boolean
    + getAlive(): boolean
    + isThrown(): boolean
    + isBeingHeld(): boolean
    + onPickedUp(p:Player): void
  }
}

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    + getObj(): Entity[]
    + getMonster(): Entity[]
    + indexOfObj(e:Entity): int
    + indexOfMonster(e:Entity): int
    + removeMonster(n:NpcChicken): boolean
  }
}

package entity {
  abstract class Entity
}

Player --> Entity : extends
Player --> window.GameWindow : uses
Player --> object.ObjBomb : may hold (0..1)
Player --> object.ObjPot : may hold (0..1)
Player --> object.ObjRock : may hold (0..1)
Player --> npc.NpcChicken : may hold (0..1)
Player "1" --> "0..*" object : inventory

note right of Player
**Notes**
- startPickup(e) は事前チェックを行う（isPickable、isAlive、投げられていない／既に保持されていないこと）。
- チェックが通れば pendingPickupEntity を設定し、状態を PICKUP に遷移させる。
- finishPickup() は最終処理を行う：配列からエンティティを削除し、onPickedUp を呼び、heldX を設定し、holding = true にし、pickupCooldown を設定する。
- fallbackToHoldWalk() はピックアップ失敗時に状態とスプライトをリセットする。

- startPickup(e) performs pre-checks (isPickable, isAlive, not thrown/held).
- If checks pass, pendingPickupEntity is set and state -> PICKUP.
- finishPickup() finalizes: removes entity from arrays, calls onPickedUp, sets heldX, sets holding=true, sets pickupCooldown.
- fallbackToHoldWalk() resets state/sprite when pickup fails.
end note

@enduml